START

Display "DormNet: Wi-Fi Monitoring System"

Display menu:
    1. Add Wi-Fi Measurement
    2. View Measurements
    3. Analyze Wi-Fi Performance
    4. View Wi-Fi Map
    5. Exit

Ask user to select an option

IF user selects "Add Wi-Fi Measurement":
    Ask for location
    Ask for date and time
    Ask for signal strength
    Ask for download speed
    Ask for upload speed
    Ask for latency

    Check if all required inputs are valid

    IF inputs are valid:
        Save measurement
        Display "Measurement successfully recorded"
    ELSE:
        Display "Invalid input"
        Ask user to enter the information again

IF user selects "View Measurements":
    Display all recorded measurements

IF user selects "Analyze Wi-Fi Performance":
    Calculate average signal strength
    Calculate average download speed
    Calculate average upload speed
    Calculate average latency

    Classify each location based on predefined thresholds

    Display analysis and summary

IF user selects "View Wi-Fi Map":
    Load dormitory map
    Display recorded measurements at their corresponding locations
    Indicate the Wi-Fi performance classification of each location

IF user selects "Exit":
    Display "Thank you for using DormNet"
    END PROGRAM

Return to menu after completing an operation

END
